uot;\">2. 이수시기 :&nbsp; 2009. 9. 1(화) ~ 12. 18(금)[해당 학기 내 실시]</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 이수기간 : 15주(105일) 이상</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 이수절차</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 실습신청(학생→종합학사행정실) - 학부장의 승인 - 수강신청(교무연구과 학사관리팀) -</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;학기중 실습 - </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2009. 12. 24(목)까지</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 관련서류 제출(학생→종합학사행정실)&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>5. 관련서류 제출 사항은 소속 학부(과) 종합학사 행정실로 문의하시기 바랍니다.<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"32\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"102\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">행정실 명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT